>	I was told that one would find the amulet at least on the 40th
>level and my finding one on the 33th compounded my beliefs that it is
>not a genuine one.

On earlier versions (the ones where the levels bottom out at 40), the Amulet
is found on whatever level below 30 you first reach.  If the first one you
reach is 40, you'll find the level there (and 40 is the limit since the
deepest is 40).  If the first one you reach is 33, you'll find the Amulet on
33.

On later versions, the Amulet is in a random location from 31 through 60.  If
you want to be _sure_ about finding it, go down to 60 and then go up 1 level
at a time until you find the correct level.

>I am trying to go down to the deeper levels and I
>have been having some problems eversince.  After I had drunk the
>potion of confusion and had read the scroll of teleportation and have
>the ring of teleport control on, I couldn't go to the deeper levels
>and the message that I received was "You feel a bit disoriented".

Having the Amulet causes teleports to be unlikely, including level teleports
(which is why you feel disoriented).  This proves your Amulet is real.

>I
>also received a lot of messages like "You yearn for your distance
>homeland"

This message is a message from a magic trap, and does nothing.

>and "You feel worried about your your pets".

This means your pet is hungry.  Hunger reduces its hit points and confuses it.
